BD x+y shifts at ℓ = 2000, best τ = 0.215: δ = 0.28466; literature (7−2√7)/6 = 0.28475. The 0.2929 = 1−1/√2 bound needs a non-full-rank sublattice (Boneh–Durfee 1999) or the unravelled linearisation `u = 1 + xy` (Herrmann–May 2010), outside this family.

